                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9ffc54f-fdfc-4fa0-a3fc-a13526e39b13",
                                "sense_id": "8f585055-7deb-344b-ad99-40e9d749c5a1",
                                "text": "Взгляну́в на э́тот база́р, мы пое́хали опя́ть по го́роду, по всем кварта́лам — по мала́йскому, инди́йскому и кита́йскому, зажима́я часте́нько нос, и веле́ли останови́ться пе́ред будди́йской куми́рней.",
                                "translation": "Having seen this bazaar, we again drove through town, through the Malay, Indian, and Chinese quarters, often holding our noses, and then asked to stop at a Buddhist shrine.",
                                "english": "Having seen this bazaar, we again drove through town, through the Malay, Indian, and Chinese quarters, often holding our noses, and then asked to stop at a Buddhist shrine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
